  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📜 模組說明 📜</span><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這個模組新增了一個可以透過資源包更改的死亡音效</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">預設為Roblox的「oof」音效，最初源自2002年的遊戲《彌賽亞》</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">以下提供資源包範本及更改死亡音效的教學</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/linfoxgamer/death-sound-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">https://github.com/linfoxgamer/death-sound-stuff</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><strong>🎥 官方展示影片 🎥</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xfddq_NrIuY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f2397124\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\" alt=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\"></span></a></span></p>",
